504
00:55:54,851 --> 00:55:56,785
Yes , actually , several cases .

505
00:56:01,758 --> 00:56:05,762
" February 19th , 1999 , Avenida Riio Mixcoac :

506
00:56:05,762 --> 00:56:07,897
High school students reported having heard

507
00:56:07,897 --> 00:56:10,764
