531
00:57:24,774 --> 00:57:25,741
No .

532
00:57:26,776 --> 00:57:27,977
Not necessarily .

533
00:57:27,977 --> 00:57:31,708
Only a sensitive and noble spirit is capable of

534
00:57:31,781 --> 00:57:34,750
